rf-story\">As of Oct 12, Castro County has a PRF record from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids October to November came in under 90% of normal in 45 of those 75 years. On the county&rsquo;s middle value, February to March 2026 came in at 6% of normal and March to April 2026 at 15%. Grid 17213 had its driest year in 2011, at 40% of normal.</p>"}
